{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:536c21ed069f143b364f356068471968938123010e20c11a2a30d81094264151",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b051820409384c739f99d11494835c86556da4ceb484d0d8cd9237d708309848",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？辛苦了。\n抱歉啊，这么晚打扰你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8edc4a525dcaa7d80297e653b8f0f4534bebb67dcacad3a55ea2b7a11cf9efa",
      "text": "终于就是明天了呢，游击突袭演出。\n啊——总觉得坐立难安的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5ad8d970d2fa6eeb2590a82d25f92c298b1b7647d95e76e791054298487da17",
      "text": "大家会不会停下脚步，\n全看我们自己的实力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7813eb4e47815956f3b6432a94a744229a8709d9308068cc6676be90575662fb",
      "text": "就像突袭演出的名字一样，必须把全场搅个天翻地覆\n让他们为我们着迷才行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71da2a34c7f4dd6e22d7aad0542c25e9f1c3ff4f734218c9c3516221c7fc3a3b",
      "text": "很期待大家的\n反应呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea8948924bacd0a59d0f25fe98c11ec0aba37e4db42ae7870b73eaa6dd4e0c97",
      "text": "我很期待会有\n怎样的反响",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21bdd7f8b6575ad23aaff85d8ba0b3bf9820bd8f7b041d3bbd8fa6612049f2f4",
      "text": "噢，大家一起打造的舞台，\n我一定会让它大获成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a366ce8d4376c52faa4bafad552028cf455121b57ccec6cf5ac54968c1119d18",
      "text": "噢，制作人的期待，\n我一定会全力回应的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bbcd1c5f3ef8b9164587e5a8979c984fc6472148500e7946a1a9e9f2f74a3e",
      "text": "顺便说一下，龙和信玄也说想看，\n我就只把地点和时间告诉他们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_402_2_4_014_02_09_b:2_4_014_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5e33960a43536b9047d82613db025fe226da8574d475bae08a72468903ee626",
      "text": "也很期待看到那帮家伙吃惊的表情啊。\n那明天就拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
